 "description": "Nvidia: $600 se duniya ki pehli $5 trillion company tak ka safar\n- 1993: Jensen Huang, Chris Malachowsky, Curtis Priem ne Nvidia shuru ki\n- Pehli chip nahi chali, Sega ke $5 million ne bachaya\n- 1997: RIVA 128 hit (jab ~1 mahine ki salary bachi thi), 1999: IPO\n- 2006: CUDA - GPU se science/research computing\n- 2012: AlexNet AI model Nvidia GPUs par train hua; ChatGPT ke baad AI chips ki demand\n- June 2024: $3 trillion; Oct 2025: $5 trillion paar karne vaali pehli company\n\nSources:\nhttps://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Nvidia\nhttps://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Jensen_Huang\nhttps://www.aljazeera.com/news/2026/11/12/why-did-nvidia-ceo-jensen-huang-resign-and-who-is-colette-kress\n\nPhotos (Wikimedia Commons):\nFile:NVIDIA Headquarters.jpg | Coolcaesar | CC BY-SA 4.0\nFile:Gaming PC-Setup - Astaroth- The Completed System.jpg | Brian Wong | CC BY-SA 2.0\nFile:Sega-Saturn-Console-Set-Mk2.jpg | Evan-Amos | CC BY-SA 3.0\nFile:Graphics Card Diamond Viper 330 with Nvidia (RIVA 128) GPU.jpg | Timothy Borkowski | CC BY-SA 3.0\nFile:Nasdaq MarketSite (51494550508).jpg | ajay_suresh | CC BY 2.0\nFile:ASUS NVIDIA GeForce 210 silent graphics card with HDMI.JPG | Joydeep | CC BY-SA 3.0\nFile:Nvidia NV40 die shot.jpg | Martijn Boer | Public domain\nFile:Racks Amravati Data Center.jpg | PiDatacenters | CC BY-SA 4.0\nFile:NASA Mars Perseverance on Nasdaq MarketSite (NHQ202102180118).jpg | NASA Headquarters / NASA/Emma Howells | Public domain\nFile:Datacenter Server Racks (22370909788).jpg | Carl Lender from Sunrise, USA | CC BY 2.0\n\n#shorts #Nvidia #JensenHuang #AI #businessstory #TechNews #hindi #60seckhabar",
